"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T18:01:13Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T18:01:13Z","body":"I think this needs to be a new license. It's another instance of at start of file varaints of the BSD license.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946791556/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946862816","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1946862816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":1946862816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850CsTg","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T18:23:53Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T18:23:53Z","body":"agree @bsdimp \r\n\r\nAdding link to license text, as I realized they are not in this issue, but over in the Fedora Gitlab repo issue\r\nhttps://github.com/krb5/krb5/blob/krb5-1.21.2-final/NOTICE#L664-L690\r\n\r\nI would note that this link was also provided: https://web.mit.edu/kerberos/krb5-1.21/doc/mitK5license.html which seems to also have some extra stuff at the bottom and I'm not sure if that's supposed to be part of the license. But based on the \"go with the license closest to the code\" guidance, I'd go with the link above.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946862816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946914095","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1946914095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":1946914095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850C40v","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T18:39:42Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T18:39:42Z","body":"did a bit more research to see if this is used elsewhere and found:\r\n* looks like a bunch of files in pthread use it, see https://opensource.apple.com/source/libpthread/libpthread-416.60.2/man/pthread_kill.2.auto.html\r\n* also in FreeBSD https://web.mit.edu/freebsd/head/lib/libc/sys/kenv.2 - note that this one has \"notice(s)\" so we might want to accommodate that with markup\r\n* apparently something called Camillia - https://www.volvocars.com/en-ca/support/car/s60l/article/98c5050d71966877c0a80151156f05d4\r\n* GL Easy Extension Library https://murlengine.com/?murlpage=3rd_party_license&murllang=en\r\n\r\nSo that makes it seem that using a project name in the license id is probably not a good idea?\r\nmaybe `BSD-2-Clause-first-lines` (or something please come up with something better!)\r\n\r\n**NOTE**: \r\nThere is also another variant of this license that seems to appear quite a bit and uses \"compiled form\" instead of \"binary\" and provides a parenthetical of example formats. see: https://patchew.org/EDK2/1492477540-41700-2-git-send-email-michael.d.kinney@intel.com/ and many of the examples here: https://github.com/search?q=%22as+the+first+lines+of+this+file+unmodified%22&type=code\r\n\r\nThese are essentially a match to the first part of https://spdx.org/licenses/FreeBSD-DOC.html - not saying we have to solve this here/now, but thought it was worth mentioning","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1946914095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1968563237","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1968563237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":1968563237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE851VeQl","user":{"login":"yvonne-metaeffekt","id":128462133,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6gtNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128462133?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt","html_url":"https://github.com/yvonne-metaeffekt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-28T09:25:24Z","updated_at":"2024-02-28T09:41:04Z","body":"**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: [freebsd-doc](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/freebsd-doc.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [BSD 2-Clause License (copyright holder variant)](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[b]/README.md#user-content-BSD-2-Clause-License-(copyright-holder-variant):~:text=BSD%202%2DClause%20License%20(copyright%20holder%20variant))\r\nshort name: BSD-2-Clause-copyright\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nThe universe match is not precise. We would consider to create another license template for the given case. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1968563237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1968609413","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1968609413","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":1968609413,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE851VpiF","user":{"login":"yvonne-metaeffekt","id":128462133,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6gtNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128462133?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt","html_url":"https://github.com/yvonne-metaeffekt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvonne-metaeffekt/repos","even