"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-06T23:43:03Z","updated_at":"2024-03-06T23:43:03Z","body":"I still agree with @jlovejoy that this is a separate license, and like her suggestion of `bsd-2-clause-first-lines`. I'd be interested in the thinking behind the suggestion that the start of the file requirement isn't an additional requirement that's not otherwise present (though it is a socially enforced convention).\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1982053263/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1986414245","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1986414245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":1986414245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE852Zkal","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-08T21:00:42Z","updated_at":"2024-03-08T21:01:43Z","body":"Also disagree with https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1968609413 that \"_as the first lines of this file unmodified_\" is redundant or doesn't change the obligations.\r\n\r\n_edited_, to clarify because of the double negative above: \"_as the first lines of this file unmodified_\" is an additional requirement above and beyond standard BSD-2-Clause.\r\n\r\n+1 to add, +1 to `BSD-2-Clause-first-lines` as ID and perhaps \"BSD 2-Clause with first lines requirement\" as name.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1986414245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2001903323","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-2001903323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":2001903323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE853Up7b","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-16T08:15:57Z","updated_at":"2024-03-16T08:15:57Z","body":"With respect to https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-1968609413:\r\n\r\nBased on the feedback we adjusted the license model to carry an equivalent modifier. The updated results are now as follow:\r\n\r\n**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [BSD 2-Clause License (copyright holder variant; retain first lines)](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[b]/README.md#user-content-BSD-2-Clause-License-(copyright-holder-variant;retain-first-lines):~:text=BSD%202%2DClause%20License%20(copyright%20holder%20variant;%20retain%20first%20lines))\r\nshort name: BSD-2-Clause-copyright-retain-first-lines\r\nmarkers: Preserve Text Obligation Marker\r\n\r\n**Comments**\r\nTo defend our comment above: if one applied the BSD license templates consistently the first lines are the copyright statement. From this default pattern the argument was, that this additional obligatios is redundant (or at least overlapping) with the \"source code must retain the above copyright notice\". Since this is a source-level obligation the risk to modify the first lines of a source file is rather low and implies a conscious modification to the source. \r\n\r\nBut we completely agree that default patterns leave room for other cases. So thanks for the discussion and resulting improvement.\r\n\r\nTo further identify such \"text preservation obligations\" we introduced an additional marker (Preserve Text Obligation Marker) that highlights such aspects independent from the license matching.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2001903323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2004540183","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-2004540183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":2004540183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE853etsX","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-18T17:36:05Z","updated_at":"2024-03-18T17:36:05Z","body":"Thanks for all the input and explanation @bsdimp @richardfontana @swinslow and @karsten-klein !","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2004540183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2004555007","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-2004555007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":2004555007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE853exT_","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-18T17:42:30Z","updated_at":"2024-03-18T17:42:33Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [x] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\nBSD 2-Clause - first lines requirement\r\n## License ID\r\nBSD-2-clause-first-lines\r\n## XML markup\r\n\r\n## Notes:\r\nThis is the same as BSD-2-Clause, but adds a specific requirement to retain the notice in the first lines of the file.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2004555007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2048857235","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348#issuecomment-2048857235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2348","id":2048857235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE856HxST","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received